-huaji:m012-0019","start":19,"end":21,"surface":"優孟","kind":"person","person_id":"3sn_ajy_26l","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m012-0026","start":26,"end":29,"surface":"負薪者","kind":"person","person_id":"fom_gr9_c8v_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m012-0032","start":32,"end":34,"surface":"優旃","kind":"person","person_id":"4qb_8ik_19m","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m012-0039","start":39,"end":41,"surface":"陛楯","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-126-huaji","book_id":"b-shiji-126","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji126-huaji"}],"sources":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-126-huaji","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-126","source_id":"s-shiji126-huaji","source":{"title":"史記／卷126","provider":"維基文庫","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/史記/卷126","permalink":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷126&oldid=2609358","revision_id":2609358,"accessed_on":"2026-10-11","extent":"固定修訂全文27段；篇文12段、褚少孫補文14段、索隱述贊1段。","image_verified":false,"rights":"古代原文；數位轉錄依維基文庫CC BY-SA 4.0，保留署名及固定版本。","license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","normalization":{"character_conversion":{},"editorial_readings":[],"extraction_note":"去header2、現代節標與wikipedia導覽模板，維基內鏈只留顯示文字，移除衛后字形選擇包裝而保留后字；未核影像。","note":"褚先生補與索隱述贊依來源節標分層，不作司馬遷篇文。"}}}],"time_policy":{"unknown_is_not_unbounded":true,"attestation_is_not_tenure":true,"date_expressions_are_not_normalized":false,"date_normalization_coverage":"partial","normalized_year_numbering":"astronomical"}}
